# Owner authorised 2026-08-20: brief repair for LJ-1.386 and LJ-1.390 (A21),
# and a mathematician ruling on LJ-1.422's critic return.
#
# These two parks are `no-change` with no record, which is the shape section
# 6.7 names for a `[[queue]]` request. harvest_batch appends them. Rule (a1)
# will not create a second task under the same code. They are REQUESTS (no
# `brief` key): the digest prints them and the refill mathematician repairs
# the existing briefs. After those briefs change, the parks still need the
# owner's `resume --retry`, because a2 never unparks `no-change`.

